sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Trader
    participant S as Server · OrderManager
    participant R as Risk gate · throttle
    participant B as Broker
    T->>S: buy 50 (lot is 75)
    S-->>T: REJECTED "50 is not a multiple of … lot size 75" (never sent)
    T->>S: buy 75, value over the account's limit
    S->>R: admit?
    R-->>S: refused: the reason
    S-->>T: REJECTED with that reason (never sent)
    T->>S: buy 75 (within every limit)
    S->>R: admit? → ok
    S->>B: place
    alt the broker refuses at once (BrokerError)
        B-->>S: error with its reason
        S-->>T: REJECTED with the broker's words
    else the broker accepts, the exchange rejects later
        B-->>S: order id → PENDING, then update REJECTED + reason
        S-->>T: REJECTED with the reason
    else no clear answer (timeout)
        S-->>T: PENDING · UNCONFIRMED (never assumed rejected)
        S->>B: order list (reconcile) settles it
    end
